  "src": "partial n by n array of n by n foreground tiles separated by one background row and column; each visible tile has one background pixel at the local coordinate matching its array coordinate",
  "dst": "empty tile slots in the same separated array",
  "transform": "complete every tile as foreground except for its coordinate-label background pixel, and keep separator rows and columns background"
}
</annotation>
